   "body": "One exception to « Désactivé : les liens s’ouvrent dans une fenêtre à l’intérieur de l’app », found by the Opus review of #1064 and checked in the code: the **« Ouvrir le lien » button of the video sheet** (`Reader/VideoPlayerSheet.swift:41`, shown when the player cannot load) always calls `openURL`, so it opens the system browser whatever the switch says. The bubble does not mention it (it is a fallback button, not a link of a message). Decision for you: leave it, or make it follow the switch (a small behaviour change, separate issue). No change made here.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
